      "source_text": "黄金船捡到了秘传之书，\n为了寻求记载在上面的赛马娘理想乡──\n伊甸园的下落，而来到了未知的土地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c5d052c3304f8d567808f5a64c7723b1152914df9e1a76352f44b056424f38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:656448d88a6eaaa85a5cf863",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是她不知道该怎么回到学园！\n被黄金船强制拖来的训练员也感到束手无策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5372e00d2946d4a784a1e1827c30f7866a188be4e9fd12b5984678412bfc45f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4b12b38aee07f9a9f8aa5b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要在这里度过余生，\n对她来说是好像没差的有差。黄金船光辉灿烂的\n赛跑人生就这样展开……了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c7a2e94382f1c08d7e151b7a6632594da57f5e4b9aa9c36e4582a16a523901",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1af6894efe04fdf5e6c2594b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1c1a5f6f69fea078a3168b694416757cabfe5fa7dd277a1d095386d7619b9cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4f46178f4aa97340ab2911",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船在梦中听见引导自己前进的声音。\n不能再发呆下去了！\n黄金船为了寻求伊甸园而开始行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef52880aa5bb84073880fc1c3903c718c86baa753ea243a3433fe309d15153dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357eb26ee8ff5e63f07809e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当黄金船提倡着\n“伊甸园＝神之领域”的独特方程式时，\n阻挡在她面前的是超级溪流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc9183e7db2950e067203b1becf27db263d1d2f1baa2e5b6601d5fc100878f47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3bdbb44d203adf1cf5330a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船使出可能是为了成神而日以继夜\n锻炼出的无数招式，但在超级溪流面前\n却像婴儿一般无用武之处。母性也太强了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8e0ce17ded0a1345ec6e11538860a162ef7b61f6a6bcde9faeade685b38f7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b085697877865a2c95912783",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "母亲比神强。在压倒性的母性面前，\n黄金船尝到了败北的滋味──\n未完待续！",
      "source_fingerprint": "573c5bbb2995dcc1cba850be2712b5bf0e4aae9ae7c183837225cb7bd1f7e440",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2b7d8b4b9359508051a8b94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "母亲比神强篇",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c3dc396b84cef41543144f66554d30ca139e7584008dcc6e1b69ff1fe100109",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084a660ef4d132e7d2a34170",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船即将在“有马纪念”\n与荣进闪耀一战──\n没想到没想到，她的美感突然觉醒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0e28c59aa2e066cce84f6156fa5d0c3d079bda3fe3bbdebc11675ad4267c7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:163e3856ff88284586452897",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船想以美称霸全世界。\n听到她的野心居然是──\n美之化身？这下好歌剧可不能视而不见！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5b9caf2b6aa5edd97f2a7202b1683107be5d2151e52a94ab1a125cab9f3319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d12e4436cd7c78ceba883ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人散发出的唯美气场，\n令人感到一阵胃痛……美的定义都快崩毁了。\n双方彼此互不相让──",
      "source_fingerprint": "686545acd1c501db5d6d14c3764a8f6d0b128e13d056ac00bf5b88df312cc62b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e35df45d7cb98ed664ff18f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──最后她们认定彼此为强敌。\n黄金船与好歌剧之间的友情才是最美丽的……\n比赛宣布平手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eab0dd666a2b9638006983a156dada12342e281cec2a31227e6845dc4d9af23c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14ab0fedd479452da941273f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标是巴黎时装秀篇",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5bf26854d5d3727696e0f5f2c6896740112a6b98d346c29e1a22e49f5aab26e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601201eee29edf84b1daa2b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船与胜利奖券搭上了电车，\n企图测试彼此身为社会人士的礼节。\n只要乖乖待在车厢里就没事了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "03797a5972ab84bf44d10d22fca2ccd0350f3f262ae2d83a4d53abe9c4fcfdb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ba88ef5894c79d4bcccf242",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──结果两人都挑战失败，社会果然很严苛。\n黄金船透过这次经验了解到很重要的事情，\n那就是绝对不能忘记，海豚可是哺乳类！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e81a4600c2e8f60e9710b7ee3f3b112ff827276c50de21185be4d6c53a2cc0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9798037cbc4d72b8fcbfd8d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船又在梦中听见引导自己前进的声音。\n听起来好像跟目白麦昆很像，\n但又似乎有点不一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aa1268ce530b821d0f8e547300c85d6eb2cf6fa72d260053c70345cab4a1a83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6df3499379378be172c1b1d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金船从目白麦昆身上感觉到\n爷爷家榻榻米的味道，\n还有下班回家的袜子味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfb6f91dc5de48fa40e46d2752cf6f4f517a84937c9e22762fef341777b9792",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92300f4779180040ed640435",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标是社会人士篇",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d66d5504abbc0587a41ead4f4a7de76ae37a351b7198d7739f8207c0813ed28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5335345ca1464cae42ade8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了弄清楚梦境真相并接近伊甸园，\n黄金船决心向中山庆典挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10166bdc84e469d38dca201086d1a21310258378c3c090a388445e94ebc22d53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1007/storytimeline_501007404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    }
  ]
}
